          "why": "The top-clicked headline was the Federal Tax Authority's VAT exemption on crypto, signalling readers have real financial exposure to UAE tax treatment and acted on news that directly changes their cost basis."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Institutional capital formation",
          "why": "Bridgetower/Deus X's $250M Abu Dhabi platform, Flowdesk's $102M raise with a UAE office, and Ethena's $20M from M2 told readers where institutional allocation is concentrating geographically."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "RWA tokenization deals",
          "why": "Mantra's $1B Damac partnership and ADI Chain's Fasset collaboration showed readers that UAE real-estate and asset conglomerates are the primary on-chain tokenization target, making it a bellwether for global RWA adoption."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "DAO legal personhood",
          "why": "RAK DAO's formal legal framework for decentralised organisations attracted readers who need jurisdictional clarity to structure on-chain entities, a gap that no major Western regulator has filled."
